{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-preset-workbench#card-zh","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-preset-workbench","commit":"886f57254a2c05dcd257f2da6c35d7e78c32e7a5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-preset-workbench 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Agent 预设可视化工作台，在设置页提供预设管理界面，并通过本机 HTTP 接口读写用户预设。用户可以分段编辑提示词、设置段落是否进入系统提示词、从模板创建预设、调整可选工具能力并校验挂载，也能打开预设目录、删除用户预设或在会话中排队切换人设。预设保存为 DSH 可加载的 bundle，并登记到 profile。适合希望在图形界面管理提示词和工具组合的 DSH 用户；需使用 DSH Web 环境，不要求额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1714-1719","lib/index.js:1979-2025","lib/index.js:1321-1397","lib/index.js:591-657"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-preset-workbench#card-en","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-preset-workbench","commit":"886f57254a2c05dcd257f2da6c35d7e78c32e7a5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-preset-workbench adds a visual preset editor to DSH web settings. Users edit prompt sections, create presets from templates, toggle tools, validate loading, open or delete presets, and queue a switch during a session. Saved presets become DSH-loadable bundles. Requires DSH web; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1714-1719","lib/index.js:1979-2025","lib/index.js:1321-1397","lib/index.js:591-657"]}
