{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-preset-workbench#feature-1","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-preset-workbench","commit":"886f57254a2c05dcd257f2da6c35d7e78c32e7a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-preset-workbench 的功能「分段提示词编辑」：读取并保存预设的段落清单与 Markdown 内容，用户可编辑标题、内容和启用状态；未启用段落仍保留但不进入提示词。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1283-1312","lib/index.js:1385-1397"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-preset-workbench#feature-2","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-preset-workbench","commit":"886f57254a2c05dcd257f2da6c35d7e78c32e7a5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-preset-workbench 的功能「模板创建」：用户在新建页挑选模板并编辑其提示词段落与能力选项，保存时复制模板内容到新的用户预设目录，生成对应配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1423-1500","lib/client.js:723-816"]}
